    <h1>50 biblical baby names<br> meanings & origins</h1>
    <p>
      Biblical baby names carry timeless significance, drawn from ancient Hebrew, Greek, and
      Aramaic roots. From the Old Testament patriarchs and matriarchs to the saints of the
      New Testament, these names have been cherished for generations. Whether you seek a
      classic like Sarah or a bold choice like Ezekiel, these biblical names offer deep
