  <!-- note on pronunciation -->
  <div class="note-card">
    <h3>🔊 A note on pronunciation</h3>
    <p>
      Many biblical names have varied pronunciations across languages and traditions.
      Names like <strong>Rebekah</strong>, <strong>Zipporah</strong>, <strong>Michal</strong>,
      and <strong>Ezekiel</strong> may sound different depending on your cultural background.
      The pronunciations provided here are common English approximations, but feel free to
